{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/546244-heavens-unleashed","id":546244,"title":"Heavens Unleashed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-08T18:26:11-07:00","id":546244,"title":"Heavens Unleashed","content":"So I'm looking over the Weather gifts and I get to Heavens Unleashed. It's an extended action that takes 10 successes to cast. Then it goes on to say it lasts 1 hour per success.<br /> <br /> So is it correct to assume that it has a minimum duration of 10 hours?<br /> <br /> My plan was to pair it with Raiment of the Storm but 10 hours+ of being unable to sleep, rest, or relax sounds like something my packmates might take umbrage with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1178-ravenmancer","name":"Ravenmancer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T18:45:55-07:00","id":546279,"title":"","content":"That sounds about right. I don't know if you can shut it off early, but the rite only works while the pack is out in the rain.<br /> <br /> I suppose you could leave the area when you no longer need the blessing, it might count as the storm having passed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T19:15:58-07:00","id":546347,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that sounds right. 10 hours is an awfully long time for a rain storm though, if you're in a part of the world where near-constant rain isn't the norm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T23:59:08-07:00","id":546605,"title":"","content":"You can lower the success threshold with exceptional successes given it's an extended action.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}